{
  "slug": "agent-knowledge",
  "name": "Agent Knowledge",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Cross-session memory for AI coding agents. A git-synced Markdown knowledge base with hybrid semantic + TF-IDF search, typed knowledge graph (11 edge types with directed BFS traversal), confidence/decay scoring, and automatic session distillation with secrets scrubbing. Reads session history from Claude Code, Cursor, and OpenCode.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `knowledge-ingest` (Ingest or update a codebase in the agent-knowledge base) and **1 MCP server**, `agent-knowledge`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install agent-knowledge@claude-community` from `keshrath/agent-knowledge`.\n\nCross-session memory and recall for AI coding assistants -- works with Claude Code, Cursor, OpenCode, Cline, Continue.dev, and Aider out of the box. Git-synced knowledge base, hybrid semantic+TF-IDF search, auto-distillation with secrets scrubbing.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
